      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "human figure",
      "description": "lower legs and feet of a person, barefoot, chained together with metal shackles, standing on sandy ground with dry leaves. The skin tone is dark, suggesting the person is Black. The chains are visibly attached to the ankles and connected by a short chain, symbolizing bondage or enslavement. The person's toenails are painted white, a detail that contrasts with the otherwise grim visual.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
