      "instance_name": "chained_person_scene",
      "label": "person_chained_to_ground",
      "description": "A scene depicting a person's lower legs and feet, barefoot and chained together with metal shackles, standing on sandy ground covered with dry leaves. The chains symbolize bondage or enslavement, and the visual is juxtaposed with text that equates dark coffee preference with slavery.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
