      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_03271754",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who may hold or be exposed to racist ideologies, particularly those who use or normalize dehumanizing metaphors that equate Black people with slavery. The target audience likely includes people who are unaware of the historical trauma associated with chattel slavery, or who are deliberately using such imagery to provoke or shock, often within online communities that propagate hate speech or racialized humor. The meme’s visual and textual elements are crafted to resonate with audiences who may find the comparison between coffee preference and slavery offensive or humorous, thereby reinforcing racist stereotypes and potentially normalizing systemic racism.",
